    "description": {
      "content": "Real-time healthcare insurance eligibility and revenue-cycle API. pVerify exchanges EDI 270/271 eligibility transactions, returns plan and benefit summaries, checks 276/277 claim status, lists supported payers, and estimates patient financial responsibility. All API calls require an OAuth2 bearer token obtained from the /Token endpoint and a Client-API-Id header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: pVerify Support",
